{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>2D PvP asymmetric multiplayer party game</strong> of mischief, pranks, and unexpected turnarounds.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Spirits cause chaos while a lone Banisher banishes them down.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting banished doesn\u2019t mean it\u2019s over \u2014 you turn into a Banisher and chase your old teammates.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/df777dc4eacb2686e6a542330f7f10c3.avif?t=1756914960\" width=800 height=124 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/4263b740f03d58f2e55a9bc370ca7f33.poster.avif?t=1756914960\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/4263b740f03d58f2e55a9bc370ca7f33.webm?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/4263b740f03d58f2e55a9bc370ca7f33.mp4?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/2a47ee58251dab3ab975829bc3631bf5.avif?t=1756914960\" width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/a39dc35ca2165e93df925bb3992e9622.poster.avif?t=1756914960\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/a39dc35ca2165e93df925bb3992e9622.webm?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/a39dc35ca2165e93df925bb3992e9622.mp4?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does the game offer?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing variable odds of losing or gaining teammates.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic and fun experience of <strong>messing with, annoying, pranking, and trolling</strong> friends or party members.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/dbac116fe217c5c35c7b812f2ea72f76.poster.avif?t=1756914960\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/dbac116fe217c5c35c7b812f2ea72f76.webm?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/dbac116fe217c5c35c7b812f2ea72f76.mp4?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEATH is not the END</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is replaced by changing role and shifting objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Spirit is banished by a banisher, it will turn into a banisher and chase the old teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active gameplay throughout the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/d971f1059ba3714459d668736ae2648a.poster.avif?t=1756914960\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/d971f1059ba3714459d668736ae2648a.webm?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/d971f1059ba3714459d668736ae2648a.mp4?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asymmetric Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starts as 1v4 and the game\u2019s asymmetry shift further during the course of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct abilities and play styles based on player\u2019s role.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/fa3f3a2e99b2d5f0d1991b548b4f2faf.poster.avif?t=1756914960\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/fa3f3a2e99b2d5f0d1991b548b4f2faf.webm?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/fa3f3a2e99b2d5f0d1991b548b4f2faf.mp4?t=1756914960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Identity</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse and Distinct character roster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own unique set of abilities and play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters offer creative skill expression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987970/extras/5b1a13b32308cbb3dc30ea5b93a5e38a.poster.avif?t=1756914960\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst